;"Everything an English adventure needs, whatever its rules: the parser and
  main loop, English vocabulary and messages, the shared world model, and
  the world verbs (look, take, open, walk, talk, save). A ruleset composes
  its own rules over this file: rulesets/classic/en.zil, rulesets/superhero/en.zil.
  Keep declaration order."
